From: ilya84 <kacnep.0000@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:28:57 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] los-tv: TV settings: BLE remotes, x86 display/network
 defaults, RTP sender

Squashed publication branch. Includes the BLE remote pairing support,
x86 display/resolution/network defaults and the native RTP sender screen
(switch, status, bitrate, editable host/port).
